<title>UK: Brent dates kept by Stasco and MStanley - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent dates kept by Stasco and MStanley - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the two Brent dates nominated from the paper chains was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by Stasco while the other was kept by Wall Street trader Morgan Stanley, traders said.</p>
<p>Both cargoes were due to load in the June 27-29 window. - London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
